  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u08e2620b\" id=\"u08e2620b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17bf09c8\" id=\"u17bf09c8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">UART（Universal Asynchronous Receiver/Transmitter，通用异步收发传输器）是一种非常基础且广泛使用的硬件通信接口。它允许两个设备之间通过简单的串行方式交换数据。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"gsuxf\" id=\"gsuxf\"><span data-lake-id=\"uddcb7897\" id=\"uddcb7897\">核心流程</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"cb2164cc\" id=\"cb2164cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31afc69a\" id=\"u31afc69a\">第一阶段：从凡人视角理解通信（纯物理体验）</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uf5520522\" id=\"uf5520522\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7786057e\" id=\"u7786057e\">关卡 1：破冰游戏 —— 两台电脑的“盲盒相亲”</span></strong></p><ul list=\"ub51fc72b\"><li fid=\"u46c98d5b\" data-lake-id=\"u545ab389\" id=\"u545ab389\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udee4959b\" id=\"udee4959b\">任务目标：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucf7551dc\" id=\"ucf7551dc\"> 忘掉 Linux，先用十几块钱的 USB 转 TTL 模块，让两台 Windows 电脑聊天。</span></li><li fid=\"u46c98d5b\" data-lake-id=\"u85b231b8\" id=\"u85b231b8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7ad927c\" id=\"uc7ad927c\">物理接线（最大的坑）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u084bd6f7\" id=\"u084bd6f7\"> 拿出三根杜邦线。</span></li><li fid=\"u46c98d5b\" data-lake-id=\"u72aa5aa0\" id=\"u72aa5aa0\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u915de962\" id=\"u915de962\">接线口诀：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubce28da4\" id=\"ubce28da4\"> 绝不能嘴巴接嘴巴！必须是</span></li></ul><ul list=\"ub51fc72b\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub8657cf6\" data-lake-id=\"ue4f93196\" id=\"ue4f93196\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0cad023a\" id=\"u0cad023a\">我的嘴巴 TX 接你的耳朵 RX</span></li><li fid=\"ub8657cf6\" data-lake-id=\"ud529f19a\" id=\"ud529f19a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8520e310\" id=\"u8520e310\">我的耳朵 RX 接你的嘴巴 TX</span></li><li fid=\"ub8657cf6\" data-lake-id=\"ua9f88fe7\" id=\"ua9f88fe7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2fbb583b\" id=\"u2fbb583b\">GND 连 GND 共地(我们站在同一个地面)</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ufa0efcc5\" id=\"ufa0efcc5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3905ef43\" id=\"u3905ef43\">关卡 2：制造混乱 —— 怎么一开口就变成火星文了？</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u4c47c5e8\"><li fid=\"u9bcf70cb\" data-lake-id=\"ucfd9bcd5\" id=\"ucfd9bcd5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua0218fc5\" id=\"ua0218fc5\">实操与顿悟：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uaafb1111\" id=\"uaafb1111\"> 两人打开串口助手聊天。老师故意让一人把波特率改成 9600，另一人保持 115200。屏幕瞬间刷出乱码。</span></li><li fid=\"u9bcf70cb\" data-lake-id=\"u3f6372b8\" id=\"u3f6372b8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u94e202a1\" id=\"u94e202a1\">降维讲解：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u634c74a4\" id=\"u634c74a4\"> 波特率就是“语速”。语速不对齐，听到的就是火星文。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Um9ik%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"9e9d62ac\" id=\"9e9d62ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5091fcc5\" id=\"u5091fcc5\">💻</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud54286d1\" id=\"ud54286d1\"> 第二阶段：唤醒沉睡的大脑（系统级排错与配置）</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u162e8bb9\" id=\"u162e8bb9\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4e1745d8\" id=\"u4e1745d8\">关卡 3：抢回 T113 的“专属麦克风”（配置 FEX 日志串口）</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u9b02e59a\"><li fid=\"u0d7696ac\" data-lake-id=\"u829d9468\" id=\"u829d9468\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u065433b3\" id=\"u065433b3\">痛点引入：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u96eb0f1c\" id=\"u96eb0f1c\"> 搞懂串口了，现在来看我们的 T113。为什么插上线，屏幕没反应？因为系统的“调试嘴巴”默认被绑错了地方！</span></li><li fid=\"u0d7696ac\" data-lake-id=\"u13ca672d\" id=\"u13ca672d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u47b543ba\" id=\"u47b543ba\">实操修改：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufc80926b\" id=\"ufc80926b\"> 在全志 Tina Linux 里，调试串口是由老旧的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u10a2d1b5\" id=\"u10a2d1b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8be2583\" id=\"uc8be2583\">sys_config.fex</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2d1db15e\" id=\"u2d1db15e\"> 掌管的。打开 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u552c5da7\" id=\"u552c5da7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9eb74d3f\" id=\"u9eb74d3f\">/root/T113-Tina5.0-V1.2/device/config/chips/t113/configs/evb1_auto/sys_config.fex</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ued95eea4\" id=\"ued95eea4\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u0d7696ac\" data-lake-id=\"uf3f492e4\" id=\"uf3f492e4\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7a47bb99\" id=\"u7a47bb99\">填入配置：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue87d6292\" id=\"ue87d6292\"> 根据原理图，我们把系统的调试输出强行绑定到 UART3（PB06 和 PB07）上：</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22sys_config.fex%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Buart_para%5D%5Cnuart_debug_port%20%3D%203%5Cnuart_debug_tx%20%20%20%3D%20port%3APB06%3C7%3E%3C1%3E%3Cdefault%3E%3Cdefault%3E%5Cnuart_debug_rx%20%20%20%3D%20port%3APB07%3C7%3E%3C1%3E%3Cdefault%3E%3Cdefault%3E%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22sys_config.fex%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yijSL%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5e1ddcb7\"><li fid=\"u436ed402\" data-lake-id=\"u006a1b9b\" id=\"u006a1b9b\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc8c8883\" id=\"udc8c8883\">确保环境配置的控制台输出用的是串口3, 波特率115200</span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22env.cfg%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22console%3DttyS3%2C115200%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22env.cfg%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22y4SD5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u5e1ddcb7\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u436ed402\" data-lake-id=\"u7751eee1\" id=\"u7751eee1\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1b2e19b5\" id=\"u1b2e19b5\">见证奇迹：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u964af6f6\" id=\"u964af6f6\"> 编译烧录，把 USB 转 TTL 接在 PG8/PG9 上，上电瞬间，屏幕刷出海量绿色 Linux 启动日志！</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u0244cede\" id=\"u0244cede\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u91db8499\" id=\"u91db8499\">关卡 4：繁衍外设 —— 在设备树里“捏”出业务嘴巴</span></strong></p><ul list=\"u76a4952f\"><li fid=\"u3378febc\" data-lake-id=\"u5f53f28c\" id=\"u5f53f28c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7c28707c\" id=\"u7c28707c\">痛点：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5bf4da45\" id=\"u5bf4da45\"> 调试麦克风用来打印日志了，那我们要外接传感器或底盘怎么办？去 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udf913c12\" id=\"udf913c12\"><span data-lake-id=\"u102491d3\" id=\"u102491d3\">board.dts</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uff8ef705\" id=\"uff8ef705\"> 里自己造！</span></li><li fid=\"u3378febc\" data-lake-id=\"uea890535\" id=\"uea890535\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua20e54dd\" id=\"ua20e54dd\">实操 1（定义引脚）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf3b43853\" id=\"uf3b43853\"> 告诉内核，物理引脚对应哪个串口控制器。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uc1d403b1\" id=\"uc1d403b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e1ea166\" id=\"u7e1ea166\">代码段</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%2F*%20UART1%20-%20PG6(TX)%2C%20PG7(RX)%20*%2F%5Cnuart1_pins_a%3A%20uart1_pins%400%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctpins%20%3D%20%5C%22PG6%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22PG7%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Ctfunction%20%3D%20%5C%22uart1%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Ctdrive-strength%20%3D%20%3C10%3E%3B%5Cn%5Ctbias-pull-up%3B%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F*%20UART2%20-%20PE2(TX)%2C%20PE3(RX)%20*%2F%5Cnuart2_pins_a%3A%20uart2_pins%400%20%7B%5Cn%5Ctpins%20%3D%20%5C%22PE2%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22PE3%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Ctfunction%20%3D%20%5C%22uart2%5C%22%3B%5Cn%5Ctdrive-strength%20%3D%20%3C10%3E%3B%5Cn%5Ctbias-pull-up%3B%5Cn%7D%3B%5Cn